  "content": "<p>模組由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 製作 - \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LinkedIn</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Scholar</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/r4Knci2k/images/7213f4ce1c84436eea0c31e9579395b8f1d6aefe.png\" alt=\"橫幅圖片\"></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Star on GitHub-fafbfc?logo=github&amp;logoColor=black\" alt=\"星標\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ynQvWygqQT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865f2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> </p><p><strong>Create: Interiors 是一個擴充模組，擴展了 Create 的裝飾選項，現已支援 Forge 與 Fabric！</strong></p><h2>功能列表：</h2><h2>•   椅子方塊</h2><p><em>擁有全部 16 種 Minecraft 染料顏色</em></p><p><em>使用板手右鍵點擊可切換扶手狀態（無、僅左、僅右、或兩側扶手）</em></p><p><em>可用 1 個有色羊毛和 2 個木材半磚合成，或用 1 個有色座椅和 1 個木材半磚合成</em></p><p><em>可以坐下，無論在機械裝置內或獨立放置皆可</em></p><p><em>可以像座椅方塊一樣拾取實體</em></p><p><em>具彈性！</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1JDWLC/resized-colors.gif\" alt=\"椅子顏色\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bJs9sQr/resized-armrests.gif\" alt=\"椅子扶手\"></p><h2>•   矮椅方塊</h2><p><em>與椅子方塊相同，但沒有椅腳</em> </p><p><em>可用 1 個有色羊毛和 2 個木材半磚合成，或用 1 個有色座椅和 1 個木材半磚合成</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RHyNcbG/Untitled.png\" alt=\"矮椅顏色\"></p><h2>•   海帶座椅</h2><p><em>羊毛椅子的更便宜、更容易種植的替代品</em></p><p><em>可用 1 個乾海帶和 1 個木材半磚合成</em></p><p><em>運作方式與 Create 的座椅方塊完全相同</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zb4mnhW/kelp-seat.png\" alt=\"海帶座椅\"></p><h2>•   海帶椅子</h2><p><em>羊毛椅子的更便宜、更容易種植的替代品</em></p><p><em>可用 1 個乾海帶和 2 個木材半磚合成，或用 1 個海帶座椅方塊和 1 個木材半磚合成</em></p><p><em>運作方式與有色椅子完全相同</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/71FCSBf/resized-kelp-chair.gif\" alt=\"海帶扶手\"></p><h2>•   海帶矮椅</h2><h2>•   座椅木材</h2><p><em>可與複製階梯與複製面板搭配，作為座椅與椅子的裝飾</em></p><p><em>3 個座椅木材可由 2 個木材半磚和 2 個木材原木合成</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rm5scrg/seatwood.png\" alt=\"座椅木材\"></p><h2>感謝貢獻！</h2><p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lopyluna/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Luna</a> 提供精美的標誌 :)</strong></p><p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/AsseyGithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@AsseyGithub</a> 將 Create: Interiors 翻譯為韓文。</strong> 🎉</p><p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/rim4oo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@rim4oo</a> 將 Create: Interiors 翻譯為俄文。</strong> 🎉</p><p>## </p><h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finteriors%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上尋找 Create: Interiors</h3><h4>回報問題請點<a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/Q8SRA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VpBf0xs/interiors.png\" alt=\"Interiors 橫幅\"></a></p>",
